		{
			dependencies: [
				"690A67A6D21199B1"
			]
			description: [
				"Clay shaped like a pot and fired &6Hot&r becomes a crucible. It hangs on a shaft between two posts and melts what goes in by the heat underneath: zinc and aluminium at &6Hot&r, copper, gold and brass at &cSearing&r, and iron, steel and netherite only at &bBlazing&r, over a superheated Blaze Burner or, later, Power Grid's basin heater past 1,200 °C."
				""
				"Old tools and armour melt for half the metal that went into them. Copper and zinc together come out as brass."
				""
				"&7JEI: the Melting and Alloying tabs.&r"
			]
			id: "57E4D8BA15816733"
			rewards: [ ]
			subtitle: "Melting by the heat below"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "0990FB159EFA7765"
